6-10-06T06:44:27.230672+00:00"}, "read_response": {"argv": ["herdr", "agent", "read", "wcheck:p3", "--source", "detection", "--lines", "80"], "cwd": null, "started": "2026-10-06T06:44:27.231273+00:00", "returncode": 0, "stdout": "Isolated boundary: idle.\n", "stderr": "", "ended": "2026-10-06T06:44:27.253914+00:00"}}, "agent_pids": [42003], "native_session": null, "agent_identity": {"agent": "codex", "name": "check-run"}, "submit_argv": ["python3", "/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/selected-entry-point.py", "--state", "/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/test_concurrent_duplicate_run_has_one_prompt_and_one_attempt-zpwta5ij/isolated state", "submit", "--task", "check-8ef2e2520a8a4011ac233168a7f95381", "--attempt", "eb8a6035a33c4b458e416688b8db9e4f", "--session", "b0391495d45740499cdff50e87844049", "--fence", "1", "--spec-rev", "1", "--commit", "FULL_COMMIT_SHA"], "prompt": "你是本地受管理任务的 worker。只执行当前 task/attempt；你不是唯一 agent，保留其他人的改动。不要改变验收 oracle、状态数据库、规格或其他任务。\ntask=check-8ef2e2520a8a4011ac233168a7f95381 attempt=eb8a6035a33c4b458e416688b8db9e4f session=b0391495d45740499cdff50e87844049 fence=1 spec_rev=1\nworkspace=/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/test_concurrent_duplicate_run_has_one_prompt_and_one_attempt-zpwta5ij/isolated state/worktrees/eb8a6035a33c4b458e416688b8db9e4f base_commit=f06a7d91d545ec501ccc8353445626225f1324e7\n任务说明（已冻结）：\n# Cursor pagination fixture v1\n\nThis is an isolated coding task for the Herdr A2A experiment.\n\nRun `python3 pager.py`. Read one JSON request from stdin and write one JSON response to stdout.\nRequests contain `items` (records with distinct string `id` and integer `ts`), `limit`,\nand optional `after` (null or [integer timestamp, string id]).\nSort records by (ts, id) ascending. Return at most limit records strictly after that pair.\nPreserve all record fields. Return `{\"items\": [...], \"next_cursor\": ...}`.\nThe next cursor is the last returned pair only if additional eligible records remain;\notherwise it is null. Input order must not matter. Do not mutate input records.\n\nLimits must be integers in [1, 100]; booleans are invalid. Invalid limit returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_limit\"}`. An after value with a wrong shape/type returns only\n`{\"error\": \"invalid_cursor\"}`. Check limit before cursor. A cursor need not exist in the input.\nEmpty results have items=[] and next_cursor=null.\n\nThe initial program is deliberately incomplete. Implement this contract without modifying\nthis document or acceptance tools. A successful model turn is not delivery acceptance.\n\n完成本地实现后，在该 worktree 创建 commit 并保持 worktree 干净。通过 git rev-parse HEAD 获取完整 SHA，替换下面 FULL_COMMIT_SHA，精确提交一次：\npython3 /Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/selected-entry-point.py --state '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/test_concurrent_duplicate_run_has_one_prompt_and_one_attempt-zpwta5ij/isolated state' submit --task check-8ef2e2520a8a4011ac233168a7f95381 --attempt eb8a6035a33c4b458e416688b8db9e4f --session b0391495d45740499cdff50e87844049 --fence 1 --spec-rev 1 --commit FULL_COMMIT_SHA\n成功交付只进入 submitted。不要 verify、integrate 或自行宣布 accepted。遇到权限/启动问题停止并报告；不要自动答复、重发或扩大范围。", "prompt_response": {"argv": ["herdr", "agent", "prompt", "wcheck:p3", "你是本地受管理任务的 worker。只执行当前 task/attempt；你不是唯一 agent，保留其他人的改动。不要改变验收 oracle、状态数据库、规格或其他任务。\ntask=check-8ef2e2520a8a4011ac233168a7f95381 attempt=eb8a6035a33c4b458e416688b8db9e4f session=b0391495d45740499cdff50e87844049 fence=1 spec_rev=1\nworkspace=/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/evidence/2026-10-06-run-01/check-20261006T064412.888838Z-ee7094b0-artifacts/test_concurrent_duplicate_run_has_one_prompt_and_one_attempt-zpwta5i